# steamlink-patches (XR Porting Hub)

Read `AGENTS.md` first. It is the single source for the app registry, exact bases,
compatibility, isolation, evidence, output and release rules. Do not add a
supported-build table here.

## Work

- Patch procedure: `.opencode/skills/morphe-patches/SKILL.md`.
- Delegation: `.opencode/skills/cavecrew/SKILL.md`.
- Evidence and open items: `diagnostics/`.
- Cleanup policy: `WORKSPACE_CLEANUP.md`.

## Commands

```powershell
.\gradlew.bat build
.\gradlew.bat :patches:test
.\Verify-Build.ps1 -Tasks ':patches:test',':patches:buildAndroid'
```

`:patches:test` is local-only; run it and report executed/skipped counts.
